      "@type": "Question",
      "name": "Does the brand affect the offer?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "The brand does play a role because it dictates the demand for salvageable parts. However, the condition, age, and sheer scrap metal weight of the car are just as important in determining the final cash offer."
